<h5 class="activityhead" id="A118">PUBG GAMING COMPETITION </h5>
<p class="paraactivity">PUBG gaming is the most online viral game and in order to understand the depth of interest in game and the ability of students in the game competition was conducted on 4-11-2018 from 9AM to 11AM with a registration fee of 100 for a team, 4 members are required for a team formation and 8 teams participated in this competition </p> 
