<h5 class="activityhead" id="A218">PROTEUS WORKSHOP </h5>
<p class="paraactivity">The Proteus Workshop was held in S7/S8 T1 classroom (Electronics Department) From 9:00 am to 4:00 pm on 6th oct 2019.<br> 9 students attended the workshop.<br>
    The workshop covered the following areas: -<br>
    Basics of Proteus software<br> Basic circuit LED using on/off using Battery<br> Digital circuit to implement a Digital Logic and 230/5 v charger<br> Archa Mohan (S7T1) handled the section about Proteus Software<br>Other coordinates included:- Akash V Nair(S5M1), Adharsh J Sankar(S5M1), Arjun Babu M k(S5M1), Gokul Krishna C U(S5M1), Aleesha S Salim(S5T1).
    </p> 
