<h5 class="activityhead" id="A318">CODING COMPETITION  </h5>
<p class="paraactivity">The coding competition “THE CCODE CHALENGE” was held on 16th November 2018 in the project lab of the CS department. Mrs. Simi Margret G.P(Staff coordinator), Gokul Raj(S5R1), Annmary Aushine(S5R1), Sruthi (S5R2), Venkatesh (S5R2) coordinated the event. The competition was conducted from 12:45pm to 1:30pm.
    The preliminary rounds for the event was conducted online via google forms. 60 students attended the preliminary round and 9 students attended the finals. Mukundan K(S5R2) emerged as the winner of the event. The cash prize of Rs.500 was awarded to the winner by Dr. Baburaj (Associate Professor, CS Department).
    </p> 
